# Sunnah Al-Hadi

A modern Android application delivering daily Sunnah reminders, employing best practices in Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and contemporary Android development.

---

## Purpose

**Sunnah Al-Hadi** aims to help Muslims revive and practice Sunnah daily through beautifully crafted reminders and a delightful user experience.

---

## ️ Tech Stack

- **Kotlin** – Primary language for all production code
- **Jetpack Compose** – Declarative, state-of-the-art UI toolkit
- **AndroidX Activity/Compose** – Modern lifecycle- and permission-aware APIs
- **Material Design 3** – Clean UI with Material You theming
- **MVVM Architecture** – (presumed for scaling up and clarity)
- **Gradle** – Build system
- **Other:** Coroutines, LiveData/State, Android Resources, etc.

---

## ️ Directory Overview

> _Actual names may vary; adapt as you add more features/folders._

```
app/
├── src/main/
│ ├── AndroidManifest.xml
│ ├── java/com/ryen/sunnah_alhadi/
│ │ ├── MainActivity.kt # App entry point
│ │ ├── presentation/
│ │ │ └── NotifcationPermissionHandler.kt # Handles notification permissions UI/logic
│ │ ├── util/
│ │ │ └── NotificationPermissionUtils.kt # Permission checking helpers
│ │ └── notification/ # (Planned: notification manager, content)
