├── build.gradle
└── ...
```

---

## ✨ Features

- **Daily Sunnah Reminders**
 - Local push notifications about Sunnah practices.
- **Smart Permission Handling**
 - Android 13+ compliant workflow:
 - Asks permission at right moment.
 - Explains rationale if blocked/denied.
 - Directs user to app settings if needed.
- **Material You UI**
 - Latest Compose and Material3 design for smooth, modern UX.
- **Efficient State & Navigation**
 - Compose state and navigation best practices to minimize bugs and ease extensibility.

---

## ️ Project Flow

### Notification Permission Workflow

- Launch checks if notification permission is granted (`hasNotificationPermission`).
- Requests permission if not yet granted (Android 13+).
- If denied, provides rationale dialog and “Open Settings” link if further denied.

### UI Layer

- All UI is Compose-based for maintainability and rapid iteration.
- Dialogs, buttons, icons from `androidx.compose.material3`.

### Utility Layer

- Utilities for checking permission rationale and OS specifics.

---

## ✅ Completed

- [x] Jetpack Compose UI for MVP (Minimum Viable Product)
- [x] Notification permission flow (Android 13+)
- [x] Material3 theming and dialogs
- [x] Permission rationale + easy settings navigation

## In Progress

- [ ] Expand and externalize Sunnah reminder content
- [ ] User settings for reminders (time, frequency, do not disturb)
- [ ] Localization/Translation support
- [ ] Notification scheduling and advanced options

## Todo/Planned

