2. **Open in Android Studio** (Giraffe+ recommended)
3. **Build & Run** on an emulator or Android 8+
4. **Try out notification workflow** – Deny/allow permissions to see all flows

---

## Contributing

- Fork, branch (`feature/my-idea`), and open PRs
- Format with ktlint/Spotless if configured
- Write tests for non-trivial logic

---

## Maintainer

**Ryen** 
Open issues or contribute via [GitHub](https://github.com/).

---

